 Train","st":"Wagon Train","d":"The preacher Andrew Hale wanders off after accidentally killing one of his congregation members.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/14fb658cd6fb5e93a4163d2545934d60/rokuFeed/assets/4b59a7fb99955448959dcf4b7920e77f.jpg","ep":"S02E35"},{"s":1796080740,"e":1796084100,"t":"Wagon Train","st":"Wagon Train","d":"A young, white man is found wandering with a band of Native Americans.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/14fb658cd6fb5e93a4163d2545934d60/rokuFeed/assets/4b59a7fb99955448959dcf4b7920e77f.jpg","ep":"S02E36"},{"s":1796084100,"e":1796087460,"t":"Wagon Train","st":"Wagon Train","d":"A woman hopes to find husbands for her daughters.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/14fb658cd6fb5e93a4163d2545934d60/rokuFeed/assets/4b59a7fb99955448959dcf4b7920e77f.jpg","ep":"S02E37"},{"s":1796087460,"e":1796090880,"t":"Wagon Train","st":"Wagon Train","d":"A talented singer falls down a flight of stairs and disfigures her face.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/14fb658cd6fb5e93a4163d2545934d60/rokuFeed/assets/4b59a7fb99955448959dcf4b7920e77f.jpg","ep":"S02E38"},{"s":1796090880,"e":1796094240,"t":"Wagon Train","st":"Wagon Train","d":"Adams, Hawks, and Wooster learn that Flint is driving a stagecoach.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/14fb658cd6fb5e93a4163d2545934d60/rokuFeed/assets/4b59a7fb99955448959dcf4b7920e77f.jpg","ep":"S03E01"},{"s":1796094240,"e":1796097600,"t":"Wagon Train","st":"Wagon Train","d":"Greenhorns board Adams' wagon train for a journey to California. Guest: Mickey Rooney.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/14fb658cd6fb5e93a4163d2545934d60/rokuFeed/assets/4b59a7fb99955448959dcf4b7920e77f.jpg","ep":"S03E02"},{"s":1796097600,"e":1796101020,"t":"Wagon Train","st":"Wagon Train","d":"A reporter organizes a suffragette movement among the married women on the train.","i":"